<title>POLAND: VISTULA JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>VISTULA JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
